1
00:00:01,760 --> 00:00:03,297
What is that?!

2
00:00:03,380 --> 00:00:07,537
Weren't Avdol's flames supposed
to be able to sense anything?!

3
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:10,140
Avdol, where are you?!

4
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:12,230
Avdol...

5
00:00:12,313 --> 00:00:14,580
has been reduced to nothingness.

6
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:19,020
You were arrogant enough to
believe you could defeat Lord Dio.

7
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:22,780
Allow me to demonstrate
just how wrong you were.

8
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:29,960
You will fall in line, one by one,

9
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:34,780
as I scatter your atomic fragments
across the recesses of the Void.

10
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:42,660
It can't be!

11
00:00:43,660 --> 00:00:45,320
I don't believe you!

12
00:00:46,060 --> 00:00:47,060
Avdol's not dead!

13
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:50,540
Don't you lie to me!

14
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:54,330
What?

15
00:00:55,140 --> 00:00:57,457
I never would have
imagined Polareth's stand

16
00:00:57,540 --> 00:00:59,817
could attack this
swiftly from so far away.

17
00:00:59,900 --> 00:01:01,720
An amazing feat to be sure.

18
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:03,240
Over here!

19
00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:05,932
I want you to look at me when I kill you!

20
00:01:34,340 --> 00:01:35,497
I'll see you

21
00:01:35,580 --> 00:01:42,580
next

22
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:48,870
time.

23
00:01:52,780 --> 00:01:55,360
It's coming to the end of the battle.

24
00:01:56,860 --> 00:02:00,017
I'm going to hit the video of the world!

25
00:02:00,100 --> 00:02:02,740
Stop it now!

26
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:07,397
It's the beginning of the story.

27
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:09,557
I'm going to take the moment.

28
00:02:09,640 --> 00:02:11,917
I'm going to continue to go.

29
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:14,900
I'm going to continue to go. Crusaders.

30
00:02:16,700 --> 00:02:21,640
The last page of the last page.

31
00:02:23,500 --> 00:02:24,382
TATAKIKKOMEEND?

32
00:02:24,900 --> 00:02:27,640
OF THE WORLD SONOCHI!

33
00:02:29,140 --> 00:02:30,560
NO Kong.

34
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:52,380
All right, now I'm sure
something fishy's going on.

35
00:02:52,580 --> 00:02:55,857
Ever since we escaped the Mirage,
I've heard the sounds of a battle.

36
00:02:55,940 --> 00:02:56,770
Blast it!

37
00:02:56,860 --> 00:02:58,860
Avdol and Polnareff are out there.

38
00:03:03,380 --> 00:03:04,400
Damn that guy!

39
00:03:04,700 --> 00:03:07,557
I know I hit the bastard, but
it wasn't enough to kill him.

40
00:03:07,640 --> 00:03:10,837
He just swallowed himself again
so he could hide in that abyss.

41
00:03:10,920 --> 00:03:12,560
Damn that guy in his stand!

42
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:23,480
Avdol, how could you do that?

43
00:03:23,740 --> 00:03:27,640
How could you break the one
rule you gave us? Pull the ref!

44
00:03:27,740 --> 00:03:29,975
Iggy, you have to get out of here now!

45
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:33,031
You told us we had to watch our own backs!

46
00:03:33,220 --> 00:03:36,279
That you wouldn't save us
even if we were in danger!

47
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:37,800
You liar!

48
00:03:40,040 --> 00:03:42,317
You've been meddling in
other people's business

49
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:45,040
ever since the moment
we set foot in India!

50
00:03:45,940 --> 00:03:46,940
Dammit, Avdol!

51
00:03:47,140 --> 00:03:51,493
Why couldn't you just leave me alone
and mind your own freaking business?!

52
00:03:53,780 --> 00:03:56,900
If I hadn't ducked, I'd
be a dead man right now!

53
00:03:57,840 --> 00:04:00,252
It's like fate is telling me to carry on!

54
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:03,854
This must be Avdol's way of
knocking some sense into me!

55
00:04:18,140 --> 00:04:19,964
It's way too dangerous in here!

56
00:04:20,700 --> 00:04:21,740
Let's get moving!

57
00:04:31,660 --> 00:04:32,760
Come on, Iggy!

58
00:04:32,940 --> 00:04:34,497
We have to make it upstairs!

59
00:04:34,580 --> 00:04:35,820
Don't fall behind!

60
00:04:44,540 --> 00:04:46,520
Look up ahead! It's the exit!

61
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:47,878
We're almost there!

62
00:04:49,300 --> 00:04:52,380
But I won't just turn tail and run away!

63
00:04:53,860 --> 00:04:57,517
Avdol sacrificed himself for us, and
I'll repay that debt no matter what!

64
00:04:57,600 --> 00:05:01,560
He believed we had the power to
put an end to Dio once and for all!

65
00:05:01,820 --> 00:05:04,617
I can't betray his faith
in us by letting him down!

66
00:05:04,700 --> 00:05:05,994
That is not an option!

67
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:11,680
I refuse to take the easy way
out like some common coward!

68
00:05:12,180 --> 00:05:14,917
I'm gonna see this fight
through to the bitter end!

69
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:18,040
The only place I'm running
to is Dio's shadow den!

70
00:05:25,520 --> 00:05:27,820
So up the stairs we go!

71
00:05:36,280 --> 00:05:39,100
I expected him to dash out the door.

72
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:40,630
Pity.

73
00:05:43,640 --> 00:05:46,017
Impressive, he managed a hit.

74
00:05:46,100 --> 00:05:49,637
It seems Polnareff's mental
fortitude gives him the

75
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:53,191
ability to conquer his fears
in the face of imminent death.

76
00:05:53,460 --> 00:05:56,640
You will soon be joining
Avdol, rest assured.

77
00:05:57,100 --> 00:06:01,629
Your strength pales in comparison to
the harbinger of death that is my stand.

78
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:07,981
If what he says is true, his stand's jaws
are the gateway to an alternate dimension.

79
00:06:08,180 --> 00:06:10,160
A dark, unimaginable abyss.

80
00:06:10,320 --> 00:06:15,202
One that allows him to move through our
realm without leaving any trace of himself.

81
00:06:16,860 --> 00:06:18,540
But how does he do it?

82
00:06:19,700 --> 00:06:22,229
And how the heck am I
supposed to beat him?

83
00:06:29,080 --> 00:06:30,220
Oh, no, no!

84
00:06:30,460 --> 00:06:31,460
He's cut us off!

85
00:06:33,300 --> 00:06:34,160
He's nearby!

86
00:06:34,740 --> 00:06:35,940
But where exactly?

87
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:38,480
Iggy, I need you to watch my back.

88
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:42,271
And don't worry, I'll do the same for you.

89
00:06:58,900 --> 00:06:59,730
Okay,

90
00:06:59,813 --> 00:07:03,477
if he wants to reach us, then he's going
to have to come out of that other realm.

91
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:04,420
This is good.

92
00:07:04,740 --> 00:07:07,577
He has to come out from the
dark beyond at some point.

93
00:07:07,660 --> 00:07:11,977
When he does, I'll take my chance and
attack him with everything I've got.

94
00:07:12,060 --> 00:07:14,457
All right, come at me,
you demented pinball!

95
00:07:14,540 --> 00:07:16,340
I'll slice you in two!

96
00:07:16,640 --> 00:07:19,287
Now I pissed off so my
chariot's even faster!

97
00:07:19,520 --> 00:07:24,380
I may have lost Avdol, but it'll be a cold
day in hell before I let you get away!

98
00:07:41,380 --> 00:07:44,520
what the hell he he was
hiding under my foot

99
00:07:55,400 --> 00:07:56,680
My foot!

100
00:07:57,280 --> 00:07:59,220
Now you can't run away.

101
00:08:00,080 --> 00:08:03,340
I got your foot so that
you can't hide anymore.

102
00:08:07,580 --> 00:08:08,860
Eat silver!

103
00:08:09,580 --> 00:08:10,580
I'll pass.

104
00:08:24,620 --> 00:08:25,450
Mr.

105
00:08:25,533 --> 00:08:26,947
Joestar, a brawl's underway!

106
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:28,480
Avdol and Polnareff!

107
00:08:28,580 --> 00:08:32,057
Sounds like they came in after us and
wound up getting themselves into a fight!

108
00:08:32,140 --> 00:08:33,140
Come on, you two!

109
00:08:33,300 --> 00:08:34,960
We have to find them ASAP!

110
00:08:40,720 --> 00:08:43,820
You've managed to hide
amid the chaos, Polnareff.

111
00:08:45,280 --> 00:08:46,400
How futile.

112
00:08:46,680 --> 00:08:49,197
You couldn't have gone
far with that injury.

113
00:08:49,280 --> 00:08:51,927
Which means you're hiding
beneath the rubble.

114
00:08:56,540 --> 00:08:59,817
By now you must have realized
you're helpless against me.

115
00:08:59,900 --> 00:09:01,959
You shall meet your end by my hand.

116
00:09:03,520 --> 00:09:06,440
Now then, where could you be, Polnareff?

117
00:09:06,700 --> 00:09:08,960
That's quite the ruckus, Cool Ice.

118
00:09:15,280 --> 00:09:16,280
Lord Dio!

119
00:09:18,520 --> 00:09:20,108
Please be careful, my lord.

120
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:24,297
I believe Polnareff and that four-legged
rudin are still hiding nearby.

121
00:09:24,380 --> 00:09:26,321
Allow me to handle the situation.

122
00:09:26,560 --> 00:09:29,854
You mustn't trouble yourself
with such nonsense, Master.

123
00:09:42,220 --> 00:09:44,320
A fake deal made from the fool.

124
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:45,560
We got him.

125
00:09:46,880 --> 00:09:50,998
You'd think I'd feel guilty about
attacking from behind like a coward.

126
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:55,320
And you'd be wrong, because you
pulled the same shit on Avdol.

127
00:09:55,540 --> 00:09:57,305
This is the death you deserve.

128
00:09:57,780 --> 00:09:59,680
Now, Iggy, crucify him!

129
00:10:09,940 --> 00:10:12,040
Now, Iggy, crucify him!

130
00:10:12,220 --> 00:10:13,737
Make him pay for what he did.

131
00:10:13,820 --> 00:10:16,817
End his life in the same
merciless way he did Avdol's.

132
00:10:16,900 --> 00:10:18,540
Send him straight to hell!

133
00:10:24,680 --> 00:10:29,657
You're kidding he knows
but how because the windows

134
00:10:29,740 --> 00:10:32,237
to my left are letting in
the light from the sun?

135
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:35,957
Lord deal would never enter
this room during the day?

136
00:10:36,040 --> 00:10:38,877
You'll suffer a thousand deaths!

137
00:10:38,960 --> 00:10:40,078
for your deception.

138
00:10:40,940 --> 00:10:41,770
Iggy!

139
00:10:51,400 --> 00:10:54,929
I made a vow to Lord Dio that
I would kill you, interlopers.

140
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:57,082
He entrusted me with that honor.

141
00:10:57,320 --> 00:10:59,017
Lord Dio's a man of his word.

142
00:10:59,100 --> 00:11:01,997
He would never descend to the
second floor for any reason.

143
00:11:02,080 --> 00:11:03,960
No, he's gonna kill Iggy.

144
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:06,593
He's about to be swallowed by the abyss.

145
00:11:07,080 --> 00:11:09,420
Now die, you filthy, pathetic dog!

146
00:11:10,500 --> 00:11:14,440
Your incorrigible ruse forced me
to destroy Lord Dio's likeness!

147
00:11:22,660 --> 00:11:24,400
Did he really just hit him?

148
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:26,480
He didn't use the void!

149
00:11:26,700 --> 00:11:29,524
Instead of killing Iggy,
he went in for a punch!

150
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:33,340
Do you know what you've done?

151
00:11:34,180 --> 00:11:35,977
I don't care if it was a fake.

152
00:11:36,060 --> 00:11:39,317
You forced me to destroy a
figure in the form of Lord Dio,

153
00:11:39,400 --> 00:11:41,540
and you must answer for that crime.

154
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:44,780
Your life is mine now!

155
00:11:45,100 --> 00:11:46,571
I will kick you to death!

156
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:53,477
My dark abyss could swallow
you whole in an instant,

157
00:11:53,560 --> 00:11:56,089
but a quick death
wouldn't satiate my fury.

158
00:11:57,260 --> 00:11:59,740
This whole mess, it's all your fault!

159
00:12:00,100 --> 00:12:02,629
This is what happens
to those who anger me!

160
00:12:02,860 --> 00:12:04,217
Have you learned your lesson yet?

161
00:12:04,300 --> 00:12:10,340
How about it? Is this better?
Tell me! Is it? Is it? Is it?

162
00:12:11,600 --> 00:12:13,380
Stop it! Leave him alone!

163
00:12:14,040 --> 00:12:16,275
It's like Cool Ice's brain has melted!

164
00:12:16,820 --> 00:12:18,937
Is he really going batshit
because he destroyed

165
00:12:19,020 --> 00:12:21,314
some pile of sand that looked like Dio?

166
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:24,960
From over here, his
soul is the murky abyss.

167
00:12:25,160 --> 00:12:27,157
It's a bottomless black
hole that obliterates

168
00:12:27,240 --> 00:12:29,593
any and everything that gets in its way!

169
00:12:32,020 --> 00:12:33,980
I was warned about the humans.

170
00:12:34,200 --> 00:12:38,357
Lord Dio said the Resolve in their
hearts must never be underestimated.

171
00:12:38,440 --> 00:12:41,400
But you, you're just a flea bitten stray.

172
00:12:41,720 --> 00:12:45,720
You've never known Resolve, and you
certainly know nothing of pride.

173
00:12:49,760 --> 00:12:51,340
You can't grin at this!

174
00:12:51,680 --> 00:12:54,720
Leave him alone! You like that? Do you?

175
00:12:55,280 --> 00:12:56,560
What did I say?

176
00:12:56,800 --> 00:12:58,897
Come on, your suffering's just begun!

177
00:12:58,980 --> 00:12:59,960
Cool Ice!

178
00:13:00,180 --> 00:13:01,800
You're dealing with me now!

179
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:07,980
I'm ending this, Polnareff.

180
00:13:15,640 --> 00:13:16,500
Damn it!

181
00:13:18,180 --> 00:13:19,160
He's gone!

182
00:13:20,200 --> 00:13:21,840
But more importantly, Iggy!

183
00:13:22,140 --> 00:13:24,757
Our plan to trick Cool Ice
may have fallen through,

184
00:13:24,840 --> 00:13:26,897
but your sand might have just saved us.

185
00:13:26,980 --> 00:13:30,333
Thanks to you, I think I found
a way to find the bastard!

186
00:13:40,400 --> 00:13:41,957
Yeah, that's him, all right.

187
00:13:42,040 --> 00:13:43,687
I can see him moving around.

188
00:13:44,300 --> 00:13:47,065
Guess your stand power
is a double-edged sword.

189
00:13:47,260 --> 00:13:51,880
When you move, your stand has no choice
but to absorb everything in your path.

190
00:13:52,460 --> 00:13:56,117
So choke on a mouthful of this and
get over here, you piece of shit!

191
00:13:56,200 --> 00:14:00,860
As soon as you come out from behind
your stand's putrid teeth to attack me,

192
00:14:01,660 --> 00:14:04,320
I'll turn the tables and finish you off!

193
00:14:05,900 --> 00:14:07,880
Bullseye, yeah! Eat that!

194
00:14:08,780 --> 00:14:10,217
Well, would you look at that.

195
00:14:10,300 --> 00:14:12,200
I found your weakness, Cool Ice.

196
00:14:12,460 --> 00:14:15,797
Any attempt to pinpoint my
location leaves you vulnerable,

197
00:14:15,880 --> 00:14:18,557
which is probably a tad
inconvenient since you can't

198
00:14:18,640 --> 00:14:21,522
see me without emerging
from your dark dimension.

199
00:14:22,240 --> 00:14:23,157
It's over!

200
00:14:23,240 --> 00:14:26,940
Now suck on my sword and
burn in hell, field de putt!

201
00:14:27,140 --> 00:14:28,600
Hurry up and die!

202
00:14:37,460 --> 00:14:38,290
What?

203
00:14:38,420 --> 00:14:40,080
How are you still alive?

204
00:14:40,360 --> 00:14:42,660
I skewed your throat and brain stem!

205
00:14:43,040 --> 00:14:44,460
Would you die already?

206
00:14:44,820 --> 00:14:46,702
No way you're getting out of it!

207
00:14:46,840 --> 00:14:48,800
Hurry up and die! Die!

208
00:14:51,340 --> 00:14:54,540
Stop making me repeat myself! Die!

209
00:14:58,340 --> 00:14:59,820
I cannot die.

210
00:15:00,040 --> 00:15:02,922
My mission is far too
important to feel any pain.

211
00:15:03,120 --> 00:15:05,240
I will not rest until I kill you.

212
00:15:05,420 --> 00:15:09,357
I'll swallow Iggy, the Joestars,
and anyone else who gets in my way.

213
00:15:09,440 --> 00:15:12,381
Only after your deaths
will I allow myself to die.

214
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:20,830
Bastard!

215
00:15:20,913 --> 00:15:22,000
There's a good boy.

216
00:15:22,180 --> 00:15:23,917
You knew to withdraw your sword.

217
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:26,200
I also know that you're about to die!

218
00:15:29,780 --> 00:15:31,040
This is the one.

219
00:15:31,260 --> 00:15:33,380
The vile arm you used to stab me.

220
00:15:39,540 --> 00:15:41,000
Knock it off!

221
00:15:42,280 --> 00:15:43,110
Damn it!

222
00:15:43,280 --> 00:15:45,515
I had no choice but to shove him away!

223
00:15:46,040 --> 00:15:46,870
No!

224
00:15:47,880 --> 00:15:49,409
You're not going anywhere!

225
00:15:51,660 --> 00:15:52,800
Did I get him?

226
00:15:53,240 --> 00:15:54,440
Where'd he go now?

227
00:15:57,320 --> 00:15:58,150
Shit!

228
00:15:58,233 --> 00:15:59,240
He got my leg!

229
00:15:59,460 --> 00:16:00,640
I can't move!

230
00:16:01,080 --> 00:16:03,609
But I can't think about
the pain right now.

231
00:16:03,780 --> 00:16:07,620
I was so close, I almost
managed to land a killing blow.

232
00:16:07,880 --> 00:16:08,960
But he got away!

233
00:16:09,560 --> 00:16:12,840
This guy is different,
fueled by pure vengeance.

234
00:16:13,220 --> 00:16:14,397
And he's not just nuts.

235
00:16:14,480 --> 00:16:19,780
His devotion to Dio is all-consuming,
but I won't let him get the upper hand.

236
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:21,765
You said you couldn't die yet?

237
00:16:21,920 --> 00:16:24,060
Well, I can't die until I kill you!

238
00:16:26,100 --> 00:16:27,820
Okay, here he comes!

239
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:29,060
Take this!

240
00:16:31,120 --> 00:16:32,460
Shit! It's no use!

241
00:16:32,640 --> 00:16:35,357
His stand just obliterated
the tip of my sword!

242
00:16:35,440 --> 00:16:38,137
Though it probably wouldn't
matter even if it were intact!

243
00:16:38,220 --> 00:16:40,997
It's impossible to attack him
when he's hidden in the abyss!

244
00:16:41,080 --> 00:16:44,433
If I so much as touch that
thing, it'll swallow me whole!

245
00:16:47,460 --> 00:16:48,290
Great!

246
00:16:48,373 --> 00:16:50,960
Now he's absorbing the
building at random! Mad!

247
00:16:53,860 --> 00:16:54,690
That's clever.

248
00:16:54,960 --> 00:16:57,657
He knows full well I'll go
after him if he shows himself.

249
00:16:57,740 --> 00:17:01,211
So he's blindly attacking to
prevent me from fighting back.

250
00:17:01,460 --> 00:17:02,872
He's not messing around.

251
00:17:03,140 --> 00:17:05,357
At this rate, he's going
to hit me for sure.

252
00:17:05,440 --> 00:17:08,205
I should pull back Chariot
and think of a plan.

253
00:17:14,400 --> 00:17:15,957
Damn this isn't good.

254
00:17:16,040 --> 00:17:20,517
He's not gonna last long if he keeps
losing blood from the state he's in.

255
00:17:20,600 --> 00:17:22,637
I'd say his broken ribs
must have punctured his

256
00:17:22,720 --> 00:17:23,550
lungs

257
00:17:23,633 --> 00:17:30,100
and

258
00:17:31,820 --> 00:17:32,650
just when I

259
00:17:32,733 --> 00:17:33,831
thought this couldn't get

260
