any worse.

261
00:17:37,973 --> 00:17:39,617
Why the hell is he devouring the walls?

262
00:17:39,700 --> 00:17:40,580
Wait a second.

263
00:17:40,820 --> 00:17:42,644
I'm starting to think I was all

264
