time to tunnel through.

281
00:18:22,140 --> 00:18:23,960
He's coming straight for us.

282
00:18:28,040 --> 00:18:29,540
Somehow I dodged it.

283
00:18:29,880 --> 00:18:31,017
Not out of the woods.

284
00:18:31,100 --> 00:18:34,597
He's closing in on me like a
needle on an old record player!

285
00:18:34,680 --> 00:18:37,037
I only have about five
more rounds before he makes

286
00:18:37,120 --> 00:18:39,885
