303
00:19:54,580 --> 00:19:55,720
Life's a bitch!

304
00:19:58,140 --> 00:20:02,140
Silver Chariot is a finesse-oriented
stand that fights with a saber.

305
00:20:02,260 --> 00:20:05,317
It simply doesn't have the
power to pull my body weight,

306
00:20:05,400 --> 00:20:07,047
