308
00:20:24,020 --> 00:20:25,860
You're holding on by a thread.

309
00:20:26,080 --> 00:20:27,668
Stay down, you stupid mutt!

310
00:20:27,840 --> 00:20:30,777
If you keep moving or try
using your stance power,

311
00:20:30,860 --> 00:20:34,566
