312
00:20:39,860 --> 00:20:42,337
Hey you can drop the
tough guy act you idiot

313
00:20:42,420 --> 00:20:44,917
the only thing this will
accomplish is you dying

314
00:20:45,000 --> 00:20:45,977
right along with me

315
00:20:46,060 --> 00:20:52,117
just you wait

316
00:20:52,200 --> 00:20:53,030
i'm the one

317
00:20:53,113 --> 00:20:55,777
who's gonna save you you
have to live on to tell Mr.

318
