Joestar and the others about this bastard
you have to defeat him in my stead?

319
00:21:00,600 --> 00:21:04,440
Avdol might have saved me, but
you sure as hell better not!

320
00:21:04,800 --> 00:21:07,859
If we all die here, then
what was the point of this?

321
00:21:10,720 --> 00:21:13,520
One more loop, and it's lights out.

322
00:21:14,320 --> 00:21:15,600
So it's number three.

323
00:21:16,360 --> 00:21:18,140
Life can be a bitch sometimes.

324
00:21:19,420 --> 00:21:21,200
We both wanted to win.

325
00:21:21,720 --> 00:21:23,400
Guess he wanted it more.

326
00:21:28,880 --> 00:21:30,920
Au River, Iggy. Woo!

327
00:22:00,600 --> 00:22:02,160
Thank you.

328
00:22:34,260 --> 00:22:36,140
Thank you.

329
00:23:24,260 --> 00:23:28,077
the blood that stings my body is avdol's

330
00:23:28,160 --> 00:23:30,857
handiwork I'm not privy
to all of the details.

331
00:23:30,940 --> 00:23:31,770
You're right.

332
00:23:31,853 --> 00:23:33,657
